$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 4'-Formyl-biphenyl-4-carboxylic acid ethyl ester (FBPCEt): To
4-formylbenzeneboronic acid (7.5 g, 50 mmol), K2CO3 (13.8 g, 100 mmol),
and Pd(PPh3)4 (1.2 g, 1 mmol), were added degassed toluene (50 ml) and
ethyl 4-iodobenzoate (14 g, 50 mmol) under Ar. The mixture was stirred at
90°C for 36 h, and cooled to room temperature, then the solvent was
removed under reduced pressure. H2O (100 ml) was added and extracted with
dichloromethane (= CH2Cl2, 200 mL×2). The collected organic layer was
dried over MgSO4 and the solvent was removed under reduced pressure. The
crude product was chromatographed on silica (CH2Cl2:hexane). 11.9 g (94%)
of title compound. 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ 10.066 (s, 1H), 8.148-8.128 (d, J
=7.8 Hz, 2H), 7.783-7.763 (d, J =7.8 Hz, 2H), 7.783-7.763 (d, J =7.8 Hz,
2H), 7.699-7.678 (d, J =8.0 Hz, 2H), 4.413-4.395 (q, J =7.1 Hz, 2H),
1.412 (t, J =7.1 Hz, 3H). MS (EI+) calcd for C16H14O3 [M]+ 254.0943.
found 254.0944.
